      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "idea-problem-class",
          "nodeId": "idea-problem"
        },
        "markdown": "## Problem\n\nThe pain, limitation, or unmet need that motivates an idea.\n\nRequired identity data: `title`.\n\nAuthored fields: `title`, `statement`, `impact`, `urgency`.\n\nThe detail surface represents every editor field; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "## Problem\n\nThe pain, limitation, or unmet need that motivates an idea.\n\nRequired identity data: `title`.\n\nAuthored fields: `title`, `statement`, `impact`, `urgency`.\n\nThe detail surface represents every editor field; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
